title: D1_NL_00_Start
---
// Set cam
<<Enable_InteractableObject SystemGame false>>
<<Fix_Camera CamController true>>
<<Reset_Camera CamController>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController "MainCam">>

<<jump D1_NL_01_Isla_Arrive>>
===

title: D1_NL_01_Isla_Arrive
---
<<MoveIn NPC_Name.Isla 2>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController CenterCam>>
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "happy">>

Isla: [wave]Good evening.[/wave]
Isla: Oh, this place is new, isn't it? I don't think I've walked by here before.
Player: Good evening. Yeah, I just opened up a few days ago.
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "neutral">>
Isla: Well, it looks lovely. Mind if I take a seat?
Player: Of course, make yourself comfortable.

-> Rough day?
    Player: You look like you've had a long one.
    Isla: [wiggle]Is it that obvious?[/wiggle] Just got off a shift.
-> First time here?
    Player: First time in the neighborhood?
    Isla: Something like that. I just never noticed this spot before.
-> Take your time.
    Player: Take your time, no rush tonight.
    Isla: [wave]Thanks, I appreciate that.[/wave]
-> Welcome in.
    Player: Welcome in, glad to have you.
    Isla: [wave]Glad to be here.[/wave]

Isla: I'm Isla, by the way.
Isla: I'm a nurse over at the local clinic, just down the road.
Player: Nice to meet you, Isla. I bet that job keeps you busy.
Isla: [wiggle]You have no idea.[/wiggle]
Player: Well, you're in the right place to unwind. What can I get you?
Isla: Do you have anything to recommend?
<<jump D1_NL_02_Isla_Order>>
===

title: D1_NL_02_Isla_Order
---
Player: [swing]Everything is recommended here.[/swing]
Isla: Umm...
Isla: Okay, I'll have [order] {Order_Cocktail_ByName_OutName("Cranberry Fizz")} [/order].
Player: Got it.

<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "neutral">>

<<flow_prepare_drinks>>

<<Fix_Camera CamController false>>
<<wait_for_task SystemGame>>

//After Isla's order
<<Enable_InteractableObject SystemGame false>>
<<Fix_Camera CamController true>>
<<Reset_Camera CamController>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController CenterCam>>

<<if $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Perfect>>
    <<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "happy">>
    Isla: [bounce]Oh, wow... this is incredible.[/bounce]
    Isla: [rainb]Seriously, you have magic hands.[/rainb]

<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Acceptable>>
    Isla: Oh, it tastes... a bit different from what I expected.
    Isla: But it's fine.

<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Fail>>
    <<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "upset">>
    Isla: [shake]Uh... Bartender?[/shake]
    Isla: I think you might have grabbed the wrong bottle.
    Isla: It's definitely not what I asked for.

<<endif>>

<<Reset_Variable SystemGame>>

<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "neutral">>
<<jump D1_NL_03_Isla_Talk>>
===

title: D1_NL_03_Isla_Talk
---
Isla: Did you just move here?
Player: Yes, just a few days ago.
Isla: It's a nice little town, once you get used to the quiet.
Isla: Actually, I'm not from around here either.
Isla: I was transferred here for work.
Player: How long have you been here?
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "happy">>
Isla: [wiggle]Long enough to stop counting.[/wiggle]
Isla: I just... ended up staying longer than I planned.
Player: Sounds like this town has a way of doing that.
Isla: [wave]Maybe it does.[/wave]
<<jump D1_NL_04_Owen_Arrive>>
===

title: D1_NL_04_Owen_Arrive
---
//Owen come in
<<Enable_InteractableObject SystemGame false>>
<<Fix_Camera CamController true>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController "MainCam">>

<<MoveIn NPC_Name.Owen 3>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController NearRightCam>>
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Owen "happy">>

Owen: [bounce a=3]Hey! hey!! Owen here![/bounce]
<<SetLookDirection NPC_Name.Isla LookDirection.Right>>
Isla: [wiggle]Ugh keep your voice down Owen.[/wiggle]
<<SetLookDirection NPC_Name.Owen LookDirection.Left>>
Owen: My bad, Isla. Nice to see you.
Owen: [shake]Wait, wait, wait[/shake] — new face behind the bar?
Owen: I thought I knew everyone in town.
Owen: Since when did this place have a bartender?
-> Hello!
    Player: Hello. I'm a Bartender.
    Player: I just opened a few days ago.
    <<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "happy">>
    Owen: Newcomer? Glad to see you.
-> Just the bartender.
    Player: Just the bartender.
    Owen: [swing]Just the bartender? No name, no story?[/swing]
    Owen: Mysterious. I like it.
-> Hey! Hey!!
    Player: hey! Hey!! Bartender here!
    <<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "happy">>
    Owen: [bounce]Now that's the spirit![/bounce]
-> Good evening.
    Player: Good evening. I'm Bartender, nice to meet you.
    <<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "neutral">>
    Owen: [wiggle]Whoa, so formal. I'm speechless.[/wiggle]
    Owen: Nice to meet you.

Owen: Well, you picked the right town to open a bar.
Owen: Looks like I've finally got a regular spot.
<<SetLookDirection NPC_Name.Isla LookDirection.Right>>
Isla: [wiggle]You show up everywhere, Owen.[/wiggle]
<<SetLookDirection NPC_Name.Owen LookDirection.Left>>
Owen: I'm easy-going. I'm fine with anywhere.
<<jump D1_NL_05_Owen_Order>>
===

title: D1_NL_05_Owen_Order
---
<<SetLookDirection NPC_Name.Owen LookDirection.Forward>>
<<SetLookDirection NPC_Name.Isla LookDirection.Forward>>

Owen: Oh right, I should probably order before the bartender kicks me out.
Owen: I'll have [order] {Order_Cocktail_ByName_OutName("Gin Fizz")}. [/order]
Player: One moment.
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Owen "neutral">>

<<flow_prepare_drinks>>

<<Reset_Camera CamController>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController "MainCam">>
<<Fix_Camera CamController false>>
<<wait_for_task SystemGame>>

//After Owen's order
<<Enable_InteractableObject SystemGame false>>
<<Fix_Camera CamController true>>
<<Reset_Camera CamController>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController CenterCam>>

<<if $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Perfect>>
    <<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Owen "happy">>
    Owen: [shake][rainb]Unbelievable![/rainb][/shake] This is amazing.
    Owen: [bounce]I should have gone to bartender school instead.[/bounce]

<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Acceptable>>
    Owen: I'm not sure, but it feels like something's missing.
    Owen: [wiggle]But it's better than not being able to drink.[/wiggle]

<<elseif $satisfaction == Satisfaction.Fail>>
    <<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Owen "upset">>
    Owen: Hmm...[waitfor=0.2/] I hate to say it, but I think something went sideways here.
<<endif>>

<<Reset_Variable SystemGame>>

<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Owen "neutral">>
<<jump D1_NL_06_Owen_Talk>>
===

title: D1_NL_06_Owen_Talk
---
Owen: Anyway.
Owen: I didn't tell you what I do for a living, did I?
Owen: Guess what I do for a living.
Owen: The hint is nature.
-> Gardener
    Owen: [wiggle]Nope. Do I look like that?[/wiggle]
-> Lumberjack
    Owen: [shake]The opposite![/shake]
-> Wildlife conservationist
    Owen: [bounce]Close! You're actually the first person to get that close.[/bounce]
-> You have a job?
    Owen: [shake]Hey! What's that supposed to mean?[/shake]

Owen: I'm a forest ranger.
Owen: I take care of the forests and the wildlife.
<<SetLookDirection NPC_Name.Owen LookDirection.Left>>
Owen: You got closer than Isla ever did.
Owen: First time we met, she thought I was homeless.
<<SetLookDirection NPC_Name.Isla LookDirection.Right>>
Isla: [shake a=2]It's because you were climbing a tree behind my dorm![/shake]
Isla: And you looked all scruffy.
Owen: Because I climbed up to catch the raccoon.
Isla: [shake]Then you fell off the tree. I was shocked.[/shake]
Owen: Luckily, it wasn't anything serious.
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Owen "happy">>
Isla: Your ankle sprained.
Owen: At least it's not broken.
Player: And what about the raccoon?
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Owen "neutral">>
Owen: It ran away before we could catch it.
Owen: It was rummaging through the trash at Cole's house.
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "neutral">>
Isla: [wiggle]That poor raccoon probably didn't know what hit him.[/wiggle]
Owen: [wiggle]Hey, I was very gentle.[/wiggle]
<<SetLookDirection NPC_Name.Owen LookDirection.Forward>>
<<SetLookDirection NPC_Name.Isla LookDirection.Forward>>
<<jump D1_NL_07_Isla_Leave>>
===

title: D1_NL_07_Isla_Leave
---
Isla: I think it's already getting late.
Isla: I should probably head home.
<<SetLookDirection NPC_Name.Owen LookDirection.Right>>
Owen: [wiggle]Come on, I was enjoying the conversation.[/wiggle]
<<SetLookDirection NPC_Name.Isla LookDirection.Left>>
Isla: I have an early shift tomorrow.
Owen: [dangle]Fine...[/dangle]
Player: Get home safe!
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Isla "happy">>
Isla: [bounce]Thanks! See you guys.[/bounce]
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Owen "happy">>
Owen: Yup, see you.
<<SetLookDirection NPC_Name.Owen LookDirection.Forward>>
<<MoveOut NPC_Name.Isla>>
<<jump D1_NL_08_Owen_Outro>>
===

title: D1_NL_08_Owen_Outro
---
//After Isla leaves
<<SetEmotion NPC_Name.Owen "neutral">>
Owen: [fade]...[/fade]
Owen: It's become a lot quieter.
Player: At least you still have me.
Owen: Yeah, you're right.
Player: So how's the job?
Owen: Mine? Oh, it's alright.
Player: What do you usually do?
Owen: Sometimes I explore on foot, or I give educational presentations to tourists.
Player: And also chase raccoons.
Owen: [wiggle]Ha, that too.[/wiggle]
Owen: But I mostly stay on the observation tower.
Owen: Keep an eye out for signs of stray animals or watch out for wildfires.
Owen: Mostly quiet. Nothing much ever happens up there.
Player: Sounds peaceful.
Owen: Yeah.
Owen: [fade]...It is.[/fade]
<<jump D1_NL_09_Owen_Leave>>
===

title: D1_NL_09_Owen_Leave
---
Owen: Anyway, I should head out too.
Owen: Early morning tomorrow.
Owen: The work never has a day off.
Player: Good luck, see you again.
Owen: Thanks, see you later.
Owen: [bounce]Owen, signing out.[/bounce]
<<SetLookDirection NPC_Name.Owen LookDirection.Left>>
<<MoveOut NPC_Name.Owen>>

Player: [fade]...Another quiet night.[/fade]
Player: Guess it's about time to close up.

<<Panel_FadeOut Panel_Transition>>
<<wait 1.5>>

<<Reset_Camera CamController>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController "MainCam">>
<<Fix_Camera CamController true>>

<<Panel_FadeIn Panel_Transition>>

<<jump D1_NL_00_Start>>
===
